    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d471">

                <pb facs="0511" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg477"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Barrett.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-08-04"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi> 4,
                        1897</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 130.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    dispatch No. 212, of the 22d of June last, reporting the arrangements made by
                    you in conjunction with the Siamese Government for the payment of the honorarium
                        <pb facs="0512" n="478" xml:id="pg478"/> and expenses of the arbitrator, Sir
                    Nicholas Hannen, in the Cheek case, and to say that your action in the matter is
                    approved by the Department.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
